        rdfs:label "docs/media/drosophila_elegans_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png (generated output)" ;
        dct:description "Bar chart states the missing sweep and ablation in the Pass 1 panel — docs/media/drosophila_elegans_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-elegans-turing-wavelength-s0.py at e7f1d7c4b94a5129fd92c9739f2ce6b72bc4ab0f, image/png, 718269 B, 1342×902 px, artifact_sha256 024ce5a6b13189dcceb1a0972eb72bfea6149ca8c200536f3fc9708616680792 (sha256 024ce5a6b13189dcceb1a0972eb72bfea6149ca8c200536f3fc9708616680792), spec_fingerprint a12bb3100b597e414ef74972864fc5e5fa6a02a00d315c7492cd5f4151bd913e" .
